Package: nrouter
Type: Package
Title: OpenAI-Compatible SDK for the nRouter LLM Gateway
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("nRouter", email = "hello@nrouter.ai", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A thin client for the nRouter LLM gateway (<https://nrouter.ai>),
    an OpenAI-compatible API. No official OpenAI SDK exists for R, so this
    package calls the HTTP API directly via httr.
